      "text": "Arrive in the capital of Ecuador. After meeting our representative, transfer to the hotel. The drive from the airport takes about an hour.\n\nThe rest of the day is set aside for checking in and resting. Quito sits high in the Andes, so a quiet first evening gives you time to adjust to the altitude before the excursions begin.\n\n**Accommodation:** Plaza Grande 5*, Royal Suite.  \n**Meals:** not specified."
